 "bio": {
  "lang": "en",
  "script": "Latn",
  "text": "Solomon Sahele Tizazu ሰለሞን ሳህለ is an Ethiopian writer and poet known for his contributions to contemporary Ethiopian literature. He has authored works including በምሥራቅ በኩል (Be Misrak Bekul), a published book that reflects his literary voice and thematic interests. Solomon’s poetry captures emotional and cultural themes, and some of his poems such as “It Is Painful – Yamal (ያማል)” have been shared and discussed online, highlighting his engagement with expressive verse. He is mentioned by peers and collaborators as a gifted poet originally from Gondar, Ethiopia, with work that has reached a national audience and has been appreciated within his literary community. የደራሲው ቀደምት ስራዎች"
 },
